## Next Steps to Enable Company Building

1. **Phase 1 (This Week):** Wire 31 starred repos across 7 capabilities
   - Creates unified API layer
   - Connects all databases
   - Implements security + auth
   - Enables dashboards + monitoring

2. **Phase 2 (Next Week):** Build workspace platform (104 ventures need it)
   - Venture collaboration layer
   - Shared resource management
   - Team communication

3. **Phase 3 (Week 3+):** Enhance with knowledge-graph + payments
   - Knowledge graph integration (already have foundation)
   - Payment processing (for monetization)
   - Sector-specific extensions

**Result:** System will be cohesive, files will understand each other, ready to build 712 ventures.
